%% render: auto
%% title: Real-world spatial reconstruction
%% desc: Capture quality decides the result. Splats stay splats unless a verified conversion is recorded.
flowchart TD
    A["Authorized photographs • consent, location rights"]:::slate
    B["Capture review • coverage, exposure, motion blur"]:::teal
    C["Camera calibration • COLMAP"]:::teal
    D["Gaussian Splatting training • 30k iterations default"]:::teal
    E["Reconstruction validation • floaters, holes, held-out views"]:::green
    F["Compatible splat viewer • target device check"]:::blue
    G["Optional verified asset conversion • losses recorded"]:::rose
    A --> B
    B -->|selected frames| C
    C -->|poses + sparse points| D
    D -->|splat PLY| E
    E -->|approved PLY| F
    E -.->|if a mesh is required| G
